PokemonTower_2F_Text_RivalIntro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Hey, {PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "What are you doing in a place\l"
    .string "like this? Your POKéMON keel\l"
    .string "over already?\p"
    .string "Ha, kidding, it's fine.\p"
    .string "Well, I can't do much for dead\n"
    .string "POKéMON, but I can make yours\l"
    .string "faint! Let's go!$"

PokemonTower_2F_Text_RivalDefeat::
    .string "What?\n"
    .string "Oh, you sneak!\p"
    .string "And here I was going easy on\n"
    .string "you, too!$"

