PokemonTower_2F_Text_RivalVictory::
    .string "{RIVAL}“あーあ‥！\n"
    .string "ほんとに　くたばっちまったぞ！\l"
    .string "よわいなー！\l"
    .string "もっと　ちゃんと　そだてて　やれよ$"

PokemonTower_2F_Text_RivalPostBattle::
    .string "So, how's your POKéDEX coming?\n"
    .string "I just caught a CUBONE, myself.\p"
    .string "Can't find a MAROWAK to save my\n"
    .string "life, though. Where are they\l"
    .string "hiding?\p"
    .string "Knowing my luck, there probably\n"
    .string "aren't any left around here.\p"
    .string "Anyway, I've got places to be,\n"
    .string "unlike some people.\p"
    .string "Smell ya later!$"

PokemonTower_2F_Text_SilphScopeCouldUnmaskGhosts::
    .string "Even we could not identify the\n"
    .string "wayward ghosts.\p"
    .string "A SILPH SCOPE might be able to\n"
    .string "unmask them.$"

